// M7 — True Name (M7.11). Original lines; book-tone meat. Act V epilogue.
=== brief ===
# page:text
# title:TRUE NAME
Back in. Kuang coiled at the core. Molly has 3Jane on the meat side. Watch the feed. The word is sung. Then type it.
* [JACK IN] -> END

=== epilogue ===
# page:text
# title:THE HEAD
Payment pipes. Turing records gone. The sacs quiet. Somewhere a new mind counts.
* [NEXT] -> coda_offer

=== erased ===
# page:text
# title:PAULEY
You pulled the plug. The construct is gone. A laugh still finds you.
* [NEXT] -> coda_offer

=== kept ===
# page:text
# title:PAULEY
You left him on the chip. ROM. He will forget this too.
* [NEXT] -> coda_offer

=== coda_offer ===
# page:text
# title:ACT V
The matrix is changed. Jack in once more, or let the credits roll.
* [JACK IN] -> END
* [CREDITS] -> END

